      "maintenance_cost": "2",
      "casting_time": "3 seconds",
      "duration": "Up to 1 hour",
      "local_notes": "Calls the nearest willing sentient humanoid or sex-bot of the appropriate gender. Range does not matter. On success the caster learns the eligible target's location and, if willing, that target is teleported to the caster. The target makes a reaction roll; on a Good reaction they cooperate for up to one hour, then vanish. Critical failure uses the Cleric Table (T.257), with the special sexual-compulsion consequences described in the source. SOURCE ODDITIES: the spell is printed as “Resisted by mother’s HT,” although no mother is inherently involved; this was preserved rather than silently corrected. The cost line is printed “3 to cast, 2 5o maintain”; maintenance has been encoded as 2, treating “5o” as the obvious typo for “to”.",
