      "points": 1,
      "local_notes": "War Sphere is four separate spells learned independently. The globe has a 6-yard-diameter spherical area. Designated subjects make HT rolls to resist, at -1 for each prior time that War Sphere has attempted to affect them; after one failed roll, they receive no further resistance rolls against later effects. Designated subjects are blinded for 1 second per full die of damage when successfully attacked.",
      "resist": "HT"
    },
